1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,972
Every tech giant now builds AI agents that read your email and act for you.

2
00:00:05,471 --> 00:00:06,649
Whose agent is yours?

3
00:00:07,019 --> 00:00:09,134
Hey Hermes is your personal assistant.

4
00:00:09,393 --> 00:00:14,908
It keeps learning how you work — at work and in private — and gets things done across all your tools.

5
00:00:15,309 --> 00:00:21,203
It runs on Hermes Agent, the most popular open-source agent. And it's just as easy as the big ones:

6
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,256
download the app, and you're ready to go.

7
00:00:23,477 --> 00:00:31,108
It's as capable as xAI's Grok Bot, Meta's Muse or Google's Gemini Spark — and just as fast, or faster.

8
00:00:31,614 --> 00:00:37,345
But it's better: you freely choose the model and the memory system, so you get the better package.

9
00:00:37,694 --> 00:00:41,229
And you stay in control: it asks before it sends.

10
00:00:41,477 --> 00:00:47,704
It lives on your own server, with full root access. And you can take your whole agent with you, any time.

11
00:00:48,249 --> 00:00:54,010
Hey Hermes. No setup, no terminal — ready in seconds at heyhermes.app.
